# EAS Build uses this file INSTEAD OF .gitignore (for any EAS build in this
# repo) once it exists at the repo root — it does not merge with .gitignore,
# and it is a pure filesystem pattern-match, not a git-tracking check.
# .git and node_modules are always excluded by EAS Build regardless of this
# file's contents.
#
# Mirrors the secrets-related exclusions from the root .gitignore, but
# carves out crypto-shield-app's generated Android app icon assets — the
# root .gitignore's blanket "*.png" rule (for repo-wide binary-asset hygiene)
# was silently dropping android/app/src/main/res/mipmap-*/ic_launcher_foreground.png
# from every EAS build archive, since that directory is regenerated by
# `expo prebuild` and isn't git-tracked.

.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets.json
credentials.json
config.local.*

*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.pdf
!crypto-shield-app/**/*.png
!crypto-shield-app/assets/**
